{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-phone-tracker-components-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-1","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-components-2","refs":["F-phone-818","F-phone-824"],"severity":"S4","title":"While the demo is loaded, the home-screen widget shows the demo's workouts with no word that they are the demo","what":"Inside the app every tab carries a 'Demo data · Remove' strip while the sample history is loaded. The home-screen widget reads the same workouts (this week's done days, the weekly goal, what to beat) but never asks whether the data is the demo, so a new member sees days ticked off on the home screen that they never trained, with no demo label. It is also not redrawn the moment the demo is removed, only when the app next goes to the background.","expected":"The widget says the numbers are the demo (or stays empty) while the demo is loaded, and redraws as soon as the demo is removed.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/widgets.ts:302-334","apps/mobile/src/tracker/components/TrackerTabBar.tsx:191-197","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/demoRemoval.ts:38-50","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/phoneSync.ts:168-177"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"widget-ignores-demo-flag","who":"new members trying the demo with a widget placed","how_often":"every time the demo is loaded and a widget is on the home screen","fix_line":"Let the widget know when the demo is loaded and label or blank it, and redraw it right after Remove","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
